event: thinking
data: {"id": "896db98f86da4120-thinking-parallel_evidence-565", "run_id": "896db98f86da4120", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "## 已采集事实\n\n1. **Pod 当前状态**：`Pending`（Prometheus 确认 `kube_pod_status_phase=Pending`，describe 也显示 Pending），而非 Running 或 Completed。\n2. **容器状态**：`Waiting`，Reason = `ContainerCreating`，Restart Count = 0。\n3. **关键事件（Events）**：\n   - `Warning FailedMount`：`MountVolume.SetUp failed for volume \"input\" : configmap \"unavailable-config\" not found`（最近 3m35s 内重复 33 次，累计 54 分钟）。\n   - `Warning FailedMount`：`Unable to attach or mount volumes: unmounted volumes=[input], unattached volumes=[input]: timed out waiting ", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789048277710, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

event: node_complete
data: {"id": "896db98f86da4120-node_complete-parallel_evidence", "run_id": "896db98f86da4120", "seq": 566, "ts_ms": 1789048286158, "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "并发证据采集", "duration_seconds": 25.19, "state_snapshot": {"contract_version": "aiops.parallel-evidence-output.v2", "group_count": 1, "expected_group_count": 1, "terminal_group_count": 1, "join_complete": true, "diagnosed_count": 1, "inconclusive_count": 0, "error_count": 0, "errors": [], "groups": [{"group_id": "g1", "presentation_index": 0, "entities": [{"kind": "Pod", "namespace": "aiops-case-03", "name": "workload-5b5fc86c8c-xn974"}], "diagnostic_status": "diagnosed", "artifact_ref": {"path": "/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/896db98f86da4120-g1/lane_artifacts/g1/artifact.json", "sha256": "a20c363688f5db05c94e2e9bf329c25d9e4ef4dd95bf0ad8e81e6da9e67768bb", "bytes": 2633}, "snapshot_sha256": "7b2148be05f8cda97fc478cb737ccb6e3e4784d943fcf6a87567300f197f56a8"}]}, "handoff_summary": ""}

event: node_start
data: {"id": "896db98f86da4120-node_start-conclusion", "run_id": "896db98f86da4120", "seq": 567, "ts_ms": 1789048286158, "node": "conclusion", "node_name": "汇总总结"}

event: node_complete
data: {"id": "896db98f86da4120-node_complete-conclusion", "run_id": "896db98f86da4120", "seq": 568, "ts_ms": 1789048295191, "node": "conclusion", "node_name": "汇总总结", "duration_seconds": 9.033, "state_snapshot": {"conclusion_length": 1692, "has_errors": false, "has_warnings": false, "conclusion": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-03/workload-5b5fc86c8c-xn974` | ContainerCreating | Pod workload-5b5fc86c8c-xn974 处于 Pending 状态，容器处于 ContainerCreating (Waiting)，卷挂载持续失败。 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | kubernetes | `FailedMount`: MountVolume.SetUp failed for volume \"input\" : configmap \"unavailable-config\" not found (fact-d4d11d39ac5f) | 直接指出根因：依赖的 ConfigMap 不存在，导致卷挂载失败 |\n| 2 | K8s Event | kubernetes | `FailedMount`: Unable to attach or mount volumes: unmounted volumes=[input]... timed out waiting for the condition (fact-6b8e5b5cc138) | 佐证卷挂载卡死的具体表现，确认挂载操作持续超时 |\n| 3 | K8s State | kubernetes | `pod.status`: Pending (fact-4f7da25123f6) | 确认 Pod 因无法完成挂载而处于 Pending 状态 |\n| 4 | K8s State | kubernetes | `container.restart_count`: 0 (fact-b3c4dd7df15a) | 排除容器崩溃重启可能性，确认处于启动前阶段 |\n| 5 | Metric | prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason`: reason=ContainerCreating, value=1 (fact-ee4d9ec20143) | 确认容器等待在创建卷/镜像阶段，与挂载失败的现象一致 |\n\n**证据链总结：**\nKubernetes 事件 (fact-d4d11d39ac5f) 提供了最直接的失败原因（ConfigMap 缺失），该失败导致挂载卷超时 (fact-6b8e5b5cc138)，进而使 Pod 卡在 Pending 阶段 (fact-4f7da25123f6) 且处于 ContainerCreating 等待状态 (fact-ee4d9ec20143)。所有证据均指向同一故障点。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n```text\nConfigMap 'unavailable-config' 缺失 → Pod 卷挂载超时/失败 → Pod 处于 Pending/ContainerCreating 状态 → 容器无法创建/用户业务不可用\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n**已确认的根因**：Pod 定义的 volume 'input' 引用了不存在的 ConfigMap 'unavailable-config'。\n\n根据事实 fact-d4d11d39ac5f，kubelet 明确报错 `configmap \"unavailable-config\" not found`，这表明卷挂载配置依赖的资源缺失是导致故障的直接原因。由于卷挂载失败，Pod 无法满足启动条件，因此一直处于 Pending 状态且无法进入 ContainerRunning 阶段（证据：fact-4f7da25123f6, fact-6b8e5b5cc138）。", "conclusion_formatted": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-03/workload-5b5fc86c8c-xn974` | ContainerCreating | Pod workload-5b5fc86c8c-xn974 处于 Pending 状态，容器处于 ContainerCreating (Waiting)，卷挂载持续失败。 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | kubernetes | `FailedMount`: MountVolume.SetUp failed for volume \"input\" : configmap \"unavailable-config\" not found (fact-d4d11d39ac5f) | 直接指出根因：依赖的 ConfigMap 不存在，导致卷挂载失败 |\n| 2 | K8s Event | kubernetes | `FailedMount`: Unable to attach or mount volumes: unmounted volumes=[input]... timed out waiting for the condition (fact-6b8e5b5cc138) | 佐证卷挂载卡死的具体表现，确认挂载操作持续超时 |\n| 3 | K8s State | kubernetes | `pod.status`: Pending (fact-4f7da25123f6) | 确认 Pod 因无法完成挂载而处于 Pending 状态 |\n| 4 | K8s State | kubernetes | `container.restart_count`: 0 (fact-b3c4dd7df15a) | 排除容器崩溃重启可能性，确认处于启动前阶段 |\n| 5 | Metric | prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason`: reason=ContainerCreating, value=1 (fact-ee4d9ec20143) | 确认容器等待在创建卷/镜像阶段，与挂载失败的现象一致 |\n\n**证据链总结：**\nKubernetes 事件 (fact-d4d11d39ac5f) 提供了最直接的失败原因（ConfigMap 缺失），该失败导致挂载卷超时 (fact-6b8e5b5cc138)，进而使 Pod 卡在 Pending 阶段 (fact-4f7da25123f6) 且处于 ContainerCreating 等待状态 (fact-ee4d9ec20143)。所有证据均指向同一故障点。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n```text\nConfigMap 'unavailable-config' 缺失 → Pod 卷挂载超时/失败 → Pod 处于 Pending/ContainerCreating 状态 → 容器无法创建/用户业务不可用\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n**已确认的根因**：Pod 定义的 volume 'input' 引用了不存在的 ConfigMap 'unavailable-config'。\n\n根据事实 fact-d4d11d39ac5f，kubelet 明确报错 `configmap \"unavailable-config\" not found`，这表明卷挂载配置依赖的资源缺失是导致故障的直接原因。由于卷挂载失败，Pod 无法满足启动条件，因此一直处于 Pending 状态且无法进入 ContainerRunning 阶段（证据：fact-4f7da25123f6, fact-6b8e5b5cc138）。"}, "handoff_summary": ""}

