data: {"id": "896db98f86da4120-final", "run_id": "896db98f86da4120", "seq": 570, "ts_ms": 1789048295203, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-03/workload-5b5fc86c8c-xn974` | ContainerCreating | Pod workload-5b5fc86c8c-xn974 处于 Pending 状态，容器处于 ContainerCreating (Waiting)，卷挂载持续失败。 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | kubernetes | `FailedMount`: MountVolume.SetUp failed for volume \"input\" : configmap \"unavailable-config\" not found (fact-d4d11d39ac5f) | 直接指出根因：依赖的 ConfigMap 不存在，导致卷挂载失败 |\n| 2 | K8s Event | kubernetes | `FailedMount`: Unable to attach or mount volumes: unmounted volumes=[input]... timed out waiting for the condition (fact-6b8e5b5cc138) | 佐证卷挂载卡死的具体表现，确认挂载操作持续超时 |\n| 3 | K8s State | kubernetes | `pod.status`: Pending (fact-4f7da25123f6) | 确认 Pod 因无法完成挂载而处于 Pending 状态 |\n| 4 | K8s State | kubernetes | `container.restart_count`: 0 (fact-b3c4dd7df15a) | 排除容器崩溃重启可能性，确认处于启动前阶段 |\n| 5 | Metric | prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason`: reason=ContainerCreating, value=1 (fact-ee4d9ec20143) | 确认容器等待在创建卷/镜像阶段，与挂载失败的现象一致 |\n\n**证据链总结：**\nKubernetes 事件 (fact-d4d11d39ac5f) 提供了最直接的失败原因（ConfigMap 缺失），该失败导致挂载卷超时 (fact-6b8e5b5cc138)，进而使 Pod 卡在 Pending 阶段 (fact-4f7da25123f6) 且处于 ContainerCreating 等待状态 (fact-ee4d9ec20143)。所有证据均指向同一故障点。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n```text\nConfigMap 'unavailable-config' 缺失 → Pod 卷挂载超时/失败 → Pod 处于 Pending/ContainerCreating 状态 → 容器无法创建/用户业务不可用\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n**已确认的根因**：Pod 定义的 volume 'input' 引用了不存在的 ConfigMap 'unavailable-config'。\n\n根据事实 fact-d4d11d39ac5f，kubelet 明确报错 `configmap \"unavailable-config\" not found`，这表明卷挂载配置依赖的资源缺失是导致故障的直接原因。由于卷挂载失败，Pod 无法满足启动条件，因此一直处于 Pending 状态且无法进入 ContainerRunning 阶段（证据：fact-4f7da25123f6, fact-6b8e5b5cc138）。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 54.5s\n├─ 问题定位: 20.3s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 25.2s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-03/workload-5b5fc86c8c-xn974: 25.2s (Evidence 16.8s, RCA 8.3s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 9.0s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-03/workload-5b5fc86c8c-xn974**: pod-volume-mount-failed\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 54.524, "metrics": {"run_id": "896db98f86da4120", "mttr": {"value": "54.5s", "seconds": 54.52932357788086, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "48%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-volume-mount-failed", "pass": true, "score": 1.0, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "完整因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-volume-mount-failed"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 54529.32357788086, "llm_calls": 14, "llm_duration_ms": 51574.90110397339, "tool_calls": 13, "executed_tool_calls": 8, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 4, "successful_tool_calls": 12, "failed_tool_calls": 1, "tool_duration_ms": 5849.8334884643555, "tool_wall_duration_